#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.14/site-packages/pygmt/src/image.py:docstring
#: of pygmt.src.image.image:10
msgid ""
"As an option, the user may choose to convert colored raster images to "
"grayscale using TV's YIQ-transformation. For raster files, the user can "
"select which color is made transparent. The user may also choose to "
"replicate the image which, when preceded by appropriate clip paths, may "
"allow larger custom-designed fill patterns to be implemented."
msgstr ""

